# Tank barrel, blue (ticket 30.7): an axial resistor: a tan ceramic body with a tin cap at the end, from a round tin knuckle.
# Pivot: the origin is the knuckle's centre, the hinge it tilts about (local x); it points along +z. In tank-computer-blue-turret it is at
# (0, 0.05, 0.13).
format 1

